01:15:07.770 --> 01:15:13.289
How We Made Your Mother is hosted and executive produced by Josh Radner and Craig Thomas.
《我们如何造就你的母亲》由乔什·拉德纳和克雷格·托马斯主持并执行制作。

01:15:13.289 --> 01:15:19.010
The show was produced by me, Alec Lev, and our co-producer is Doug Madica.
该节目由我 Alec Lev 制作，我们的联合制作人是 Doug Madica。

01:15:19.010 --> 01:15:29.409
Our audio producer and mixer is Alex Reeves at Point of Blue Studios, and our digital content producer AKA Gen Z Master is Emily Blumber.
我们的音频制作人和混音师是 Point of Blue Studios 的 Alex Reeves，我们的数字内容制作人又名 Gen Z Master 是 Emily Blumber。

01:15:29.409 --> 01:15:31.050
Artwork by John Morrow.
约翰·莫罗的艺术作品。

01:15:31.050 --> 01:15:36.649
Please follow, rate, and review the show on Apple Podcasts or your podcast player of choice.
请在 Apple 播客或您选择的播客播放器上关注、评分和评论该节目。

01:15:36.649 --> 01:15:38.489
It really does help the show.
对节目确实有帮助。

01:15:38.489 --> 01:15:45.489
Our theme song is NYC by our own Josh Radner, with additional music by Craig Thomas and Andrew Majewski.
我们的主题曲是我们自己的 Josh Radner 创作的《NYC》，其他音乐由 Craig Thomas 和 Andrew Majewski 创作。

01:15:45.489 --> 01:15:48.829
Special thanks to Lola Kennedy and Elliot Connors.
特别感谢洛拉·肯尼迪和埃利奥特·康纳斯。

01:15:48.829 --> 01:15:55.250
Visit HowWeMajorMother.com to sign up for our sub-stack mailing list and for links to our social media.
请访问 HowWeMajorMother.com 注册我们的子堆栈邮件列表以及我们社交媒体的链接。

01:15:55.250 --> 01:15:59.930
You can also click on the contact page to send us an email or a voice message.
您还可以单击联系页面向我们发送电子邮件或语音消息。

01:15:59.930 --> 01:16:03.130
Your stories and questions are an important part of the show.
您的故事和问题是节目的重要组成部分。

01:16:03.130 --> 01:16:04.130
Want some merch?
想要一些商品吗？

01:16:04.130 --> 01:16:08.250
Click on the store link or go to HowYouGetYourMerch.com.
单击商店链接或访问 HowYouGetYourMerch.com。

01:16:08.250 --> 01:16:22.529
Subscribe to Josh Radner's Muse Letters on Substack, order Craig Thomas' debut novel at CraigThomasRider.com slash novel, and you could subscribe to my Dead Father's Society, also on Substack.
在 Substack 上订阅乔什·拉德纳 (Josh Radner) 的《Muse Letters》，在 CraigThomasRider.com 斜杠小说上订购克雷格·托马斯 (Craig Thomas) 的处女作，你还可以在 Substack 上订阅我的《死去父亲的协会》(Dead Father's Society)。

01:16:22.529 --> 01:16:30.050
To learn about how you make a difference, this shows ongoing campaign to raise money for congenital heart disease research.
要了解您如何做出改变，这显示了正在进行的为先天性心脏病研究筹集资金的活动。

01:16:30.050 --> 01:16:33.649
Check out the Make a Difference tab at the top of our website.
查看我们网站顶部的“Make a Difference”选项卡。

01:16:33.649 --> 01:16:37.529
This episode was made possible by the support of Backyard Ventures.
这一集是在 Backyard Ventures 的支持下才得以实现的。

01:16:37.529 --> 01:16:40.369
People will, in fact, dance.
事实上，人们会跳舞。

01:16:40.369 --> 01:16:49.960
Real question, it just hit me, am I in love, or just New York City?
真正的问题，它突然击中了我，我是恋爱了，还是只是纽约市？

